module line-count
edition 0
needs console and files


to count-lines of path (text) giving an integer, needs files, may fail with not-found:
    let text be try files.read-text path
    give back count of split text by "\n"


to main, needs console and files, may fail with not-found:
    with files limited to "./data", read only:
        show count-lines of "./data/lines.txt"
        show count-lines of "./secret.txt"
